1
00:00:00,505 --> 00:00:03,905
(Penny:)It does have
a camera in it.

2
00:00:03,908 --> 00:00:06,708
(Leonard:)Baby's listening.

3
00:00:06,711 --> 00:00:08,511
(knocks)
SHELDON: Leonard?

4
00:00:08,513 --> 00:00:10,383
(knocks) Leonard?
(knocks) Leonard?

5
00:00:10,381 --> 00:00:11,511
(Raj:)What?

6
00:00:11,516 --> 00:00:13,616
(Sheldon:)I spoke to the reporter
at the magazine.

7
00:00:15,852 --> 00:00:18,152
(Bernadette:)What happened?
Did you tell him it was my idea?

8
00:00:18,155 --> 00:00:19,185
(Amy:)I did.

9
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:21,090
(Leonard:)Thank you. What did he say?

10
00:00:21,092 --> 00:00:23,822
(Sheldon:)He said they made
the editorial decision

11
00:00:23,828 --> 00:00:25,928
(Sheldon:)to only cite the lead scientist.

12
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:28,360
(Leonard:)Why did he think
you're the lead scientist?

13
00:00:28,366 --> 00:00:30,336
It was my idea!

14
00:00:30,334 --> 00:00:31,604
(Raj:)You know,
for an extra four bucks,

15
00:00:31,602 --> 00:00:33,532
(Penny:)I can have this thing
here tomorrow.

16
00:00:33,538 --> 00:00:35,738
(Sheldon:)Well, I know it
was your idea,

17
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:38,910
(Sheldon:)but the reporter said he's been
following my work for a while,

18
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,910
(Sheldon:)and the only reason they even
mentioned it in the magazine

19
00:00:40,912 --> 00:00:42,182
(Sheldon:)is 'cause my name is on it.

20
00:00:42,179 --> 00:00:44,979
(Penny:)You know what? I did it.
What's four bucks?

21
00:00:44,982 --> 00:00:46,912
(Leonard:)If you're trying
to make me feel better,

22
00:00:46,918 --> 00:00:48,348
(Leonard:)it's not working.

23
00:00:48,352 --> 00:00:51,182
(Sheldon:)Well... then what if I told you

24
00:00:51,188 --> 00:00:54,288
(Sheldon:)that I added your name
to the cable bill?

25
00:00:56,259 --> 00:00:58,699
(Sheldon:)No.
Oh.

